{"id": "141903", "name": "מרחבי מכפלה פנימית - טענות כלליות - 14", "qtype": "truefalse", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 1, "options": {}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\">\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\">\n<p>לכל וקטורים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v_1,v_2\\in V\\)</span>,</p>\n<p>אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(v_1\\perp v_2\\)</span>, אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert v_1 + v_2\\rVert^2 = \\lVert v_1 \\rVert^2 +\\lVert v_2 \\rVert^2\\)</span>.</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"native-answer\">[[input:ans]]</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> בשאלה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(V\\)</span> הוא מרחב מכפלה פנימית מעל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}\\)</span> או <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{C}\\)</span>. נפתח את הריבוע לפי הגדרת הנורמה.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — פתיחת הריבוע</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\lVert v_1+v_2\\rVert^2=\\langle v_1+v_2,v_1+v_2\\rangle=\\lVert v_1\\rVert^2+\\langle v_1,v_2\\rangle+\\langle v_2,v_1\\rangle+\\lVert v_2\\rVert^2. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — ניצבות</b><br><span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\langle v_1,v_2\\rangle=0\\)</span>, וגם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\langle v_2,v_1\\rangle=\\overline{\\langle v_1,v_2\\rangle}=0\\)</span>. לכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert v_1+v_2\\rVert^2=\\lVert v_1\\rVert^2+\\lVert v_2\\rVert^2\\)</span> (משפט פיתגורס).<p style=\"text-align:center\"><b>הטענה נכונה.</b></p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans", "type": "radio", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": false, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "native": {"shuffle": false, "numbering": "none", "instruction": "one", "lang": "he"}}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "native": true, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": []}], "qvnames": [], "nvariants": 1}